  "releaseNotes": "Add DIExtensions using ConditionalWeakTable & Make model APIs public and add factory support:\n      - Introduces DIExtensions.cs which provides simple, instance-level dependency injection using a private ConditionalWeakTable to associate singleton services with object instances.\n      - Adds two extension methods: Inject<TService> (this object instance, TService service) to attach a service, and GetService<TService> (this object instance) to retrieve it (throws InvalidOperationException if missing).\n      - Methods are marked with MethodImplOptions.AggressiveInlining for performance.\n      - Change model accessors from internal to public and tighten nested classes to private. Reintroduce manual-instance APIs (GetModelI/SetModelI/DestroyModelI) with a guard that throws if no manual instance is set.\n      - Add factory-based APIs (SetModelT/GetModelT/DestroyModelT) and an InstanceFactoryRegister to register Func<T>factories.\n      - Preserve existing default-constructor-backed InstanceRegister<T> (eagerly initializes instance) and keep MethodImplOptions.AggressiveInlining attributes.",
